"Construct Diagnostics": {
  "index": "-94",
  "category": "constructs",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Construct Diagnostics"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "From time to time, I find myself asking \"What is my construct doing??\" \n\nEnter the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Construct Diagnostics Command",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nI can select this command from your "
        },
        {
          "text": "Bell of Bidding",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "'s radial menu and activate a construct to get a live view into its brain.\n\nThis diagnostics screen provides a great deal of information about my construct including its stats, capabilities and its "
        },
        {
          "text": "inventory",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nWhile I cannot directly put items into a construct's inventory through Diagnostics, "
        },
        {
          "text": "I can use it to instruct the construct to drop any item in a slot",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "(click on the item)",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": ".  I can also "
        },
        {
          "text": "pin",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " a construct's diagnostics to the main HUD, which will show me a live view of their tasks while I do other things.  I can unpin it using the button in my inventory."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "crafting",
      "location": "mna:bell_of_bidding"
    }
  ]
}